  prompt: Inspect
  id: motel_register
  title: The motel register
  text: 'Pale Moon Motel guest register. June 2nd: H. Semple, Rm 3, ''brushes & notions''. No check-out. Then nothing for four months. October 15th: Rm 6, PAID IN ADVANCE, CASH, EXACT CHANGE. No name. That entry isn''t in the same handwriting as the others. It''s in yours.'
  subject: 
  customPrompt: Read the register
  nerveShock: 6
  awareness: 0
