  id: marsh_crayons
  title: A boy's crayon tin
  text: 'A flat tin of crayons, most of them worn to stubs, pushed to the back of the shelf. Scratched inside the lid: DANNY M. The grey one is the only crayon in it that still has a point. It''s the only one nobody has used in four years.'
  subject: June Marsh
  customPrompt: Look in the tin
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
