  prompt: Inspect
  id: marsh_grave
  title: A boy's grave
  text: A small stone, older than the new ones. DANIEL MARSH, 1971-1979. 'Our boy.' The grass around it is cut with scissors, and there's a grey crayon lying on the ledge, worn to a stub.
  subject: June Marsh
  customPrompt: Read the small stone
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
